#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:211
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Give agents autonomy over the investigation.{ph1} Set a clear goal and "
"acceptance criteria, then let the agent decide what to try next."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Berikan otonomi kepada agen atas penyelidikan.{ph1} Tetapkan tujuan dan"
" kriteria penerimaan yang jelas, lalu biarkan agen memutuskan apa yang akan "
"dicoba selanjutnya."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:216
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Use the repository and Git as working memory.{ph1} Keep the reasoning "
"with the code. Git checkpoints let the next session continue after the "
"conversation ends."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Gunakan repositori dan Git sebagai memori kerja.{ph1} Pertahankan "
"alasannya dengan kodenya. Titik pemeriksaan Git memungkinkan sesi berikutnya"
" berlanjut setelah percakapan berakhir."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:221
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Let evidence decide what you claim.{ph1} A confident explanation still "
"needs testing. “Unknown” is a valid answer when the evidence is incomplete."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Biarkan bukti memutuskan apa yang Anda klaim.{ph1} Penjelasan yang "
"meyakinkan masih perlu diuji. \"Tidak diketahui\" adalah jawaban yang valid "
"jika buktinya tidak lengkap."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:226
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Test the oracle too.{ph1} Try cases it should reject. If it misses a "
"bug, revisit the earlier results that depended on it."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Uji referensi verifikasi (oracle) juga.{ph1} Coba kasus yang harus "
"ditolak. Jika melewatkan bug, kunjungi kembali hasil sebelumnya yang "
"bergantung padanya."

#. {ph0}: <strong >
#. {ph1}: </strong >
#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:231
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}We are in the early days of RE's industrial revolution.{ph1} The "
"methods are still taking shape. There is plenty left to explore."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Kita berada di masa-masa awal revolusi industri RE.{ph1} Metodenya "
"masih terbentuk. Ada banyak hal yang tersisa untuk dijelajahi."

