#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:7
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"Try REA on a small Notes app. Set up your agent, ask where exported notes "
"go, and check the CSV formatter with a sample title."
msgstr ""
"Coba REA di aplikasi Catatan kecil. Siapkan agen Anda, tanyakan ke mana "
