msgid ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Use REA to build an RL environment from my test web app at "
"{ph3}. Cover listing, creating, renaming, and deleting folders. You may "
"create and remove test folders. Leave existing data unchanged. Save it in a "
"folder named {ph4}. Check which operations work and tell me how to run "
"it.{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Gunakan REA untuk membuat lingkungan RL dari aplikasi web "
"uji saya di {ph3}. Cakup daftar, pembuatan, penggantian nama, dan "
"penghapusan folder. Boleh membuat dan menghapus folder uji, tetapi jangan "
"ubah data yang sudah ada. Simpan dalam folder bernama {ph4}, periksa operasi"
" yang berfungsi, dan beri tahu cara menjalankannya.{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}"

