msgctxt "shared"
msgid ""
"REA: Find out how software works. Reverse engineering with your coding "
"agent."
msgstr ""
"REA-Cari tahu cara kerja perangkat lunak. Rekayasa balik dengan agen "
"pengkodean Anda."

#: website/public/index.html:357
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"REA helps your agent read the code and see what the program does while it "
"runs."
msgstr ""
"REA membantu agen Anda membaca kode dan melihat apa yang dilakukan program "
"saat berjalan."

#: website/public/index.html:1104
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"Your agent records the browser's requests and the app's responses. REA uses "
"them to build a local environment where agents can practice tasks without "
"running the original app."
msgstr ""
"Agen Anda merekam permintaan browser dan respons aplikasi. REA menggunakan "
"data tersebut untuk membuat lingkungan lokal tempat agen dapat berlatih "
"mengerjakan tugas tanpa menjalankan aplikasi aslinya."

#: website/public/index.html:1109
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"To support folder deletion, the recording must show the folder before "
"deletion and confirm it is gone afterward."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mendukung penghapusan folder, rekaman harus menunjukkan folder sebelum"
" dihapus dan memastikan folder tersebut sudah tidak ada setelahnya."

